<title>UK: Hydro Quebec sets 1.5 billion Ffr bond due 2008.</title>
<headline>Hydro Quebec sets 1.5 billion Ffr bond due 2008.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYDRO QUEBEC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  THE PROVINCE OF QUEBEC (RATED A2/A+)</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    13.MAR.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.425   PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.80     SPREAD	+44 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	INTEREST AND PAYMENT OF PRINCIPAL WILL BE CONSIDERED</p>
<p>AS DENOMINATED AND PAYABLE IN EUROS IF THE FRENCH FRANC IS REPLACED BY THE EURO  </p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10    SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    QUEBEC    HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
